{title: Yamma Yamma}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi R D Burman}
{key: B}

{c: Verse 1}
[B]Yamma [Em]yamma [B]yamma yamma
[Em]Yeh [B]khubsurat sama
[G]Bas aaj ki [B]raat hai zindagi
[B]Kal hum kahan tum kahan
[B]Kab kya hojae kisko khaber
[Em]Aa [B]nachle jhumkar
[B]Yeh zindagi ek lamba safar
[Em]Pal bhar ke [B]sab hum safar
[G]Ek raat ke [B]mehmaan sab Yahan
[B]kal hum kahan tum kahan
[B]Haste huwe aisi shaan
[Em]Se deewane [B]jal jaenge
[B]Are jalti shama se milke
[Em]Gale parwane [B]jal jaenge
[G]Reh jayga [B]yado ka diyaa
[B]Kal hum kahan tum kahan
